    "directions": [
      "Combine all ingredients in a large pitcher, adding clementine syrup last and to taste. Chill thoroughly. When ready to serve, place ice block in a punch bowl and pour punch over. Float clementine slices in the punch and garnish each serving with small coins of clementine peel gently squeezed over the glass.\nClementine Zest SyrupUse a microplane grater to remove the zest from the two clementines. Add zest to 8 1/2 oz. of cold simple syrup (1:1). Cover and refrigerated overnight or up to 24 hours. Strain out the zest and keep the syrup refrigerated."
